  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Central America through its tram depot. Win the defector over with a Persuader and bring them out alive, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 9 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Central America Defection: Ironwood Trust runs Central America from its tram depot, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to bring the defector out alive and walk out the exit.",
